<title>MALAYSIA: Telekom Malaysia bonus issue approved.</title>
<headline>Telekom Malaysia bonus issue approved.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telekom Malaysia Bhd said on Wednesday that its proposed one-for-two bonus issue of up to 1.02 billion new shares has been approved by the Securities Commission.</p>
<p>In a statement, Telekom said the issue is still subject to approval by shareholders at an extraordinary general meeting to be held on April 29.</p>
<p>The bonus issue will increase Telekom's issued and paid-up share capital to 2.999 billion ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
